                        <br><br>

                        <<link [[무릎을 꿇는다|Seaspray Hotel Events Knees]]>><<sub 1>><</link>>
                        <br>
                        <<link [[비명을 지른다|Seaspray Hotel Events Scream]]>><<pain 4>><</link>><<gpain>>
                        <br>
                        <<link [[싸운다|Seaspray Hotel Events Fight]]>><<def 1>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
                        <br>
                    <</if>>
                <<else>>
                    <<person1>><<person>>【은는】 우스꽝스러운 표정을 지어 보이지만, 그 밖에는 당신을 건드리지 않는다.
                    <br><br>

                    <<link [[다음|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
                    <br>
                <</if>>
